    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000qugg](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000qugg) Magnitude 6.3 earthquake at 144.571 depth occurred on Jul 23 2025 17km E of Marisa. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 0.4437 longitude 122.0857. It impacted 104635 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
